      ],
      "text_preview": "\n3.The learned counsel for the petitioner reiterated all the contentions set out in the affidavit filed in support of this writ petition and called upon this Court to set aside the impugned order and grant the relief as prayed for."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "54eb5ab3e9534a3e8474b4250ff8f593_25",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Vide order dated 02.01.2024 in WP(MD)Nos.30871 and 30873 of 2023, I had held that sealing of the premises can be done only if the procedure set out in Section 38(1)(c) of the Food Safety and Standards Act,\n2006 could not be fulfilled."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f1a973ebc5384f72ad23952a1e2dc425_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the case on hand, the respondents have not pleaded anywhere that the food business operator was not available."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d04e721d56b4466ab5b52a049c838a39_27",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I had also invoked the principle of proportionality in the said case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b570bd6e45354c84a14590fc9dddc31d_28",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Sealing had been done as early as on 06.12.2023."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9610697a4d9f4e37870d4eb3aadb1f28_29",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "More than a month has elapsed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bdaf183cbcdc4f438f6bad92b407e5d5_30",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner's shop cannot be kept closed indefinitely."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4262df192bfb47b784fdd0d3f6bb9918_31",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has a bearing on his right to livelihood."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7a62b3d199434a938f49a4b28e95e133_32",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n6.The impugned order is rather drastic in nature."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "48810c10ad964fcca0560bc93cf230c4_33",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is true that under Regulation 2.1.8(4) of Food Safety and Standards (Licensing and Registration of Food Business) Regulations, 2011, the authority can suspend the petitioner's license."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "322c2fa299284a2cbb2a9adb0e86339a_34",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But, in this case, the order of https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis suspension has been passed as a final order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "84b3549f71d7471abdf3747a6e25176f_35",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is evident from the fact that the petitioner has been granted liberty to file an appeal before the Commissioner of Food Safety."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "33b297b576ca4542bb62230e3495d25e_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Allahabad High Court in Harishchandra v. State of U.P (2020 AHC 8080) had held that before passing such an order,\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1093e09104374ea98a3ea9c317b561d2_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "principles"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d3af6cb05c324bae986d53f13b3d22ea_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "of natural justice"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ee6a9c6d27384d87bb5ad9f51f29690e_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "I can understand if an interim suspension order is passed, notice is given to the licensee and thereafter final order is passed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f0f9b8579f1344a5943865ec434cc616_41",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this case,\nstraightaway final order under the aforesaid regulation has been passed without notice."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "57f382024b344480ac135f52e53c336f_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
